From 6292811203f5786e46273afd211479ec22681859 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port Bot <port@local>
Date: Thu, 21 May 2026 17:18:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: token exchange mode for upstream cluster API

Adds AUTH_USER_MODE env var to select between user impersonation
(default, existing behavior) and token-exchange. In token-exchange
mode the authenticator-issued access token is exchanged for one
usable directly against the upstream cluster API. Supports RFC 8693
token exchange and Azure AD on-behalf-of flows, with an in-memory
TTL cache keyed by a hash of the subject token.
---
 pkg/auth/oauth2/auth_oidc.go      |  50 +++++++-
 pkg/auth/oauth2/token_exchange.go | 203 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 pkg/proxy/proxy.go                |   6 +-
 pkg/server/server.go              |  21 +++-
 4 files changed, 271 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 pkg/auth/oauth2/token_exchange.go

